    <name>MiniNotes</name>
    <summary>Offline-first notes application</summary>

    <developer id="io.github.ahmad-j-bary">
        <name>Ahmad Abdelbary</name>
    </developer>

    <description>
        <p>
            MiniNotes is a small offline-first notes application built
            with Qt, QML, C++ and SQLite.
        </p>
        <p>
            Notes are stored locally and remain available without an
            Internet connection.
        </p>
        <p>
            Create, edit and manage notes through a lightweight desktop
            interface designed for fast offline use.
        </p>
    </description>

